
MSTEST - INT 33h from a DOS box
  INT 33h points at a driver ok
  00h reset: AX FFFFh, two buttons ok
  24h version 8.20, and the type ok
  21h software reset ok
  2Ah hidden, hot spot 0,0, the type again ok
  03h after a reset: the middle, no buttons ok
  04h, and 03h rounds to a cell ok
  26h 640 by 200 ok
  07h range, and the pointer inside it ok
  08h range ok
  movement: 8 mickeys a cell across, 16 down ok
  0Bh counts, and starts again ok
  0Fh ratio ok
  1Ah/1Bh speed 100 moves twice as far ok
  1Ah back to 50 ok
  back up and left ok
  stops at the edge of the range ok
  slow movement adds up ok
  a PS/2 packet and a serial one, decoded ok
  a PS/2 packet through the 8042 and IRQ 12 ok
  05h/06h left press and release ok
  05h/06h right and middle ok
  text cursor drawn, moved, and kept off a write ok
  0Ah hardware cursor ok
  10h region hides it, 01h shows it ok
  1Dh/1Eh page ok
  15h/16h/17h save and restore ok
  0Ch handler on movement, with the registers ok
  0Ch handler on the buttons ok
  0Ch mask chooses the events ok
  14h swaps the handler out ok
  18h/19h Ctrl handler ok
  1Fh/20h disable and enable ok
  INT 15h C2h refused ok
  the 8042's mouse is out of a box's reach ok
  32h, 25h, 6Dh, 4Dh ok
  mode 13h cursor ok
  mode 12h cursor, VGA registers kept ok
  mode 4 cursor ok
MSTEST done.
